@startuml
!include ../../../../../../plantuml/sodexo-theme.puml

title Configure supplier integrations — Configure and test supplier profile
header Sat, 25 Jul 2026 · End-to-end discovery sequence
footer (c) Developed by <b>Mohit Kanwar</b>

hide footbox
autonumber
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 90

actor "Sodexo Administrator" as Actor
participant "Sodexo Employee Webapp" as Surface
participant "API Gateway" as Gateway
participant "Administration API" as Edge
participant "Integration Configuration Service" as Service1
database "Service-owned data" as Data
queue "Kafka event platform" as Events
participant "Booking.com Demand API" as BookingCom #FBDADD


group 1. Return endpoint, feature, resilience, and secret-reference configuration.
  Actor -> Surface: Return endpoint, feature, resilience, and secret-reference configuration
  Surface -> Gateway: GET /api/v1/platform/integrations/{integrationId}
  Gateway -> Edge: JWT, tenant scope, correlation ID
  Edge -> Service1: Return endpoint, feature, resilience, and secret-reference configuration.
  alt authorised and valid
  Service1 -> Service1: Authorise and query
  Service1 -> Data: Read or commit Integration Configuration Service data
  Service1 --> Edge: Scoped result
  Edge --> Surface: Response envelope
  Surface --> Actor: Updated journey state
else validation, state, or dependency failure
  Service1 --> Edge: Problem details + retryability
  Edge --> Surface: Safe error and next action
  Surface --> Actor: Correct, retry later, or escalate
end
end

group 2. Run a non-destructive connectivity and capability test.
  Actor -> Surface: Run a non-destructive connectivity and capability test
  Surface -> Gateway: POST /api/v1/platform/integrations/{integrationId}/tests
  Gateway -> Edge: JWT, tenant scope, correlation ID
  Edge -> Service1: Run a non-destructive connectivity and capability test.
  alt authorised and valid
  Service1 -> Service1: Authorise and query
  Service1 -> BookingCom: sandbox health/reference request
  BookingCom --> Service1: Supplier response + request_id
  Service1 --> Edge: Scoped result
  Edge --> Surface: Response envelope
  Surface --> Actor: Updated journey state
else validation, state, or dependency failure
  Service1 --> Edge: Problem details + retryability
  Edge --> Surface: Safe error and next action
  Surface --> Actor: Correct, retry later, or escalate
end
end

@enduml
